  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Reproducible engineering baseline package for a GF(137) edge-inference
  kernel. Includes HYP-002 through HYP-005: equivalent float32 modular
  baselines, shape sweeps, a C++ int8 proxy, an ONNX Runtime int8 baseline,
  local Apple ARM runs, Linux VPS runs, and GitHub Actions CI. The package
  supports a narrow claim: GF(137) provides compact exact finite-field
  inference semantics with stable storage reduction, while runtime performance
  against standard int8 runtimes is shape- and hardware-dependent.
